{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>And Moses arose.</b> By reason it is that Joshua went from Israel's camp with Moses, and he remained at the bottom of the mountain until Moses' descent, for he did not know about the calf that was made, and there is no reason to ask what he ate, for the manna was around the camp to gather and eat day by day."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:37:59.052018092Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}